<h1><span lang="EN-GB">Window Menu</span></h1>
<hr align="center" size="5" class="whs3">
<p>This is a standard Windows menu for manipulating windows in a multi-document application. It is divided in 2 sections:</p>
<table cellspacing="5" class="whs4">
<col>
<col>
<tr valign="top" class="whs5">
<td class="whs6">
<p><img src="../images/window_menu.gif" width="326px" height="160px" border="0" class="img_whs7" alt=""></p>
</td>
<td valign="middle" class="whs8">
<table cellspacing="0" width="248" class="whs9">
<col class="whs10">
<tr valign="top" class="whs11">
<td valign="middle" width="100%" class="whs12">
<p class="whs13"><a href="#Windows">Windows manipulation commands</a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs14">
<td valign="middle" width="100%" class="whs12">
<p class="whs15"><a href="#Open_Windows">Open windows list</a></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p class="sub-head"><a name="Windows"></a>Windows manipulation commands</p>
<table width="808" cellspacing="0" class="whs16">
<col class="whs17">
<col class="whs18">
<col class="whs19">
<tr valign="top" class="whs20">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="18.523%" class="whs21">
<p class="caption">Command</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="72.937%" class="whs22">
<p class="caption">Description</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="4.125%" class="whs23">
<p class="caption">Details</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs20">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="18.523%" class="whs24">
<p class="normal-table-func">Bind Views - None</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="72.937%" class="whs25">
<p class="normal-table">Disables Bind Views modes.</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="4.125%" class="whs26">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/bind_views_none.htm"><img src="../images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs27" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs20">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="18.523%" class="whs24">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Bind Views - Absolute</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="72.937%" class="whs25">
<p class="normal-table">This command will cause all open documents to display the same visible region and to update all views simultaneously according to the active window.</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="4.125%" class="whs26">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/bind_views.htm"><img src="../images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs27" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs20">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="18.523%" class="whs24">
<p class="normal-table-func">Bind Views - Relative</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="72.937%" class="whs25">
<p class="normal-table">This command will cause all open documents to display the same visible region and to update all views simultaneously according to the active window. Extents of the other windows are locked when this mode is enabled and the they are changed relatively according to the active window.</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="4.125%" class="whs26">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/Bind_Views_Relative.htm"><img src="../images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs27" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs20">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="18.523%" class="whs24">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Cascade</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="72.937%" class="whs25">
<p class="normal-table">Overlaps in cascade way all open windows.</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="4.125%" class="whs26">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/cascade.htm"><img src="../images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs27" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs20">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="18.523%" class="whs24">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Tile Vertically</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="72.937%" class="whs25">
<p class="normal-table">Tiles in vertical direction all open windows.</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="4.125%" class="whs26">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/Tile_Vertically.htm"><img src="../images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs27" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs20">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="18.523%" class="whs24">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Tile Horizontally</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="72.937%" class="whs25">
<p class="normal-table">Tiles in horizontal direction all open windows.</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="4.125%" class="whs26">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/Tile_Horizontally.htm"><img src="../images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs27" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs20">
<td width="18.523%" class="whs24">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Close All</span></p>
</td>
<td width="72.937%" class="whs25">
<p class="normal-table">Closes all open windows. KUBE issues warning for every modified document.</p>
</td>
<td width="4.125%" class="whs26">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/close_all.htm"><img src="../images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs27" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
