<p class="sub-head"><a name="Open_Windows"></a>Open windows list</p>
<table width="808" cellspacing="0" class="whs28">
<col class="whs29">
<col class="whs30">
<col class="whs19">
<tr valign="top" class="whs20">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="18.688%" class="whs21">
<p class="caption">Command</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="72.772%" class="whs22">
<p class="caption">Description</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="4.125%" class="whs23">
<p class="caption">Details</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs20">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="18.688%" class="whs24">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Select window</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="72.772%" class="whs25">
<p class="normal-table">The second section of this menu contains list of all open documents and their copies. Selecting an item from this list will activate (move to front or restore window size if it is minimised) the corresponding window. Currently active window is marked with a tick.</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="4.125%" class="whs26">
<p class="normal-table">-</p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>

